# Patches must keep their exact bytes: a CRLF rewrite makes `git apply` fail and
# silently changes the diff context. Never let Git touch these.
*.patch -text
*.patch eol=lf

# Bash / PowerShell helpers and docs: normalise to LF in the repository so the
# patches above stay byte-stable and the docs render the same everywhere.
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
